lth endpoints**","**Summarizing cost reduction recommendations with citations**","**Verifying Terraform state and billing access limitations**","**Explaining tracing and logging trade-offs**","**Verifying Terraform state and billing access limitations**","**Explaining tracing and logging trade-offs**","**Analyzing trace data billing concerns**","**Preparing detailed billing and configuration citations**","**Analyzing trace data billing concerns**","**Preparing detailed billing and configuration citations**","**Analyzing trace data billing concerns**","**Preparing detailed billing and configuration citations**","**Recommending sampling and retention optimizations**"]},{"type":"agentMessage","id":"item-5289","text":"Yes. We can reduce custom trace cost by roughly **91%** without removing tracing entirely.

